  31: ["The paper is unlit. Pressing A B C D in the dark does nothing (and costs nothing).", "The pause menu's DARK MODE is the trap: it changes the hall, not the paper.", "The switch is the lightbulb in the logo above the paper. It is greyed out and blinks once after 15 seconds. Click it.", "Lit, the instruction reads PRESS THE THIRD BUTTON. Click C."],
  32: ["The dial is labelled MAX 10, but the track secretly goes one notch further.", "Click and drag the knob all the way to the right end — to 11."],
  33: ["Nothing in the paragraph is misspelled. The word 'because' is simply sitting where it makes no sense.", "Do not click words to accuse them. Drag 'because' down into the blank in the examiner's own remark and drop it there."],
